      "value": "Having the reverse would be a great improvement too.\nFor example linking to a vrchat user with `https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_....` requires a login and forgets the page you tried to go to. That makes for some very poor embed / linking in discord to let someone friend you outside the game.",
